###Login correcto ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login correcto USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "user123"
}


### Checkear sesión (con login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/session

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout

